# Pinned VK-port debt for tools/glsl_port_diff.py --all.
# Format (TAB separated): port name, VK file, hash of the exact post-rename diff, WHY.
# These are REAL VK gaps, not noise. The row stays green only while the diff is byte-for-byte
# what is pinned here: a port that goes verbatim (stale entry) or drifts further fails.
# Re-pin with: py -3 tools/glsl_port_diff.py --all --print-hashes
